# "Loses all abilities" takes only the abilities an object has when it applies (CR 613.1f, 613.7): an ability granted by a
# later effect is had. Bot1's Tishana's Tidebinder counters Thraben Inspector's own enters trigger, so the Inspector loses
# all abilities while the Tidebinder stays (no Clue). Two turns later Banishing Knack gives the Inspector "{T}: Return
# target nonland permanent to its owner's hand" - an effect with a later timestamp - and the Inspector uses it on Bot2's Mox
# Jet.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Thraben Inspector
Tishana's Tidebinder
Banishing Knack
Mox Sapphire
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Swamp x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thraben Inspector.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack = Thraben Inspector
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Tishana's Tidebinder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Stack.Thraben Inspector)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Sapphire; Thraben Inspector; Tishana's Tidebinder
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Banishing Knack.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Thraben Inspector)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Thraben Inspector.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand = Mox Jet; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Thraben Inspector.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Banishing Knack; Black Lotus
